<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="ChatGPT">
  <diagram id="peer-mentorship-corrected" name="Peer Mentorship Corrected">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2800" dy="2200" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2800" pageHeight="2200" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />

        <mxCell id="title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;" value="UniConnect – Corrected Peer-to-Peer Mentorship Class Diagram" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="20" width="1860" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="user" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#4d4d4d;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«shared reference»&lt;br&gt;User&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- userId : Long&lt;br&gt;- platformRole : PlatformRole&lt;br&gt;- accountStatus : AccountStatus&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="105" width="380" height="225" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="student" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#4d4d4d;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«profile-module reference»&lt;br&gt;StudentProfile&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- studentNumber : String&lt;br&gt;- yearOfStudy : Integer&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1390" y="110" width="380" height="205" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="alumni" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#4d4d4d;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«profile-module reference»&lt;br&gt;AlumniProfile&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- graduationYear : Integer&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1880" y="110" width="380" height="185" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="skill" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#4d4d4d;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«profile-module reference»&lt;br&gt;Skill&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- skillId : Long&lt;br&gt;- skillName : String {unique}&lt;br&gt;- category : String [0..1]&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="2340" y="105" width="360" height="220" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="service" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«domain service»&lt;br&gt;PeerMentorshipService&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;+ registerMentor(userId, details)&lt;br&gt;+ updateMentorProfile(mentorId, details)&lt;br&gt;+ setMentorStatus(mentorId, status)&lt;br&gt;+ createSlot(mentorId, schedule)&lt;br&gt;+ updateSlot(slotId, mentorId, details)&lt;br&gt;+ closeSlot(slotId, mentorId)&lt;br&gt;+ cancelSlot(slotId, mentorId)&lt;br&gt;+ joinSlot(slotId, studentId, message, goal)&lt;br&gt;+ leaveSlot(slotId, studentId)&lt;br&gt;+ searchMentors(filters)&lt;br&gt;+ browseSlots(filters)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="430" width="535" height="535" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="mentor" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;MentorProfile&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- mentorProfileId : Long&lt;br&gt;- mentoringBio : String&lt;br&gt;- status : MentorStatus&lt;br&gt;- registeredAt : LocalDateTime&lt;br&gt;- updatedAt : LocalDateTime&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="450" width="430" height="330" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="expertise" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;MentorExpertise&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- mentorExpertiseId : Long&lt;br&gt;- description : String [0..1]&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1320" y="485" width="390" height="220" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="slot" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;MentorshipSlot&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- slotId : Long&lt;br&gt;- topic : String&lt;br&gt;- description : String&lt;br&gt;- scheduleType : ScheduleType&lt;br&gt;- startDate : LocalDate&lt;br&gt;- startTime : LocalTime&lt;br&gt;- endTime : LocalTime&lt;br&gt;- recurrenceEndDate : LocalDate [0..1]&lt;br&gt;- mode : MentorshipMode&lt;br&gt;- location : String [0..1]&lt;br&gt;- meetingLink : String [0..1]&lt;br&gt;- capacity : Integer&lt;br&gt;- status : SlotStatus&lt;br&gt;- createdAt : LocalDateTime&lt;br&gt;- updatedAt : LocalDateTime&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;+ currentEnrollmentCount() : int&lt;br&gt;+ availablePlaceCount() : int&lt;br&gt;+ isFull() : boolean&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1830" y="405" width="520" height="735" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="occurrence" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;MentorshipOccurrence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- occurrenceId : Long&lt;br&gt;- startsAt : LocalDateTime&lt;br&gt;- endsAt : LocalDateTime&lt;br&gt;- cancelledAt : LocalDateTime [0..1]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;+ isPast(now) : boolean&lt;br&gt;+ isCancelled() : boolean&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="2390" y="520" width="390" height="330" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="enrollment" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;MentorshipEnrollment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- enrollmentId : Long&lt;br&gt;- joinMessage : String [0..1]&lt;br&gt;- learningGoal : String [0..1]&lt;br&gt;- joinedAt : LocalDateTime&lt;br&gt;- leftAt : LocalDateTime [0..1]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;+ isCurrent() : boolean&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1550" y="1240" width="430" height="365" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notification" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«shared reference»&lt;br&gt;Notification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;- notificationId : Long&lt;br&gt;- recipient : User&lt;br&gt;- type : NotificationType&lt;br&gt;- eventKey : String&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="2240" y="1280" width="410" height="250" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="mentorStatus" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#4d4d4d;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«enumeration»&lt;br&gt;MentorStatus&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;AVAILABLE&lt;br&gt;UNAVAILABLE&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="1080" width="285" height="175" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="scheduleType" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#4d4d4d;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«enumeration»&lt;br&gt;ScheduleType&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;ONE_TIME&lt;br&gt;WEEKLY&lt;br&gt;BIWEEKLY&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="1080" width="300" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mode" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#4d4d4d;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«enumeration»&lt;br&gt;MentorshipMode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;IN_PERSON&lt;br&gt;ONLINE&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="735" y="1080" width="300" height="175" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="slotStatus" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#4d4d4d;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;«enumeration»&lt;br&gt;SlotStatus&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.45;&quot;&gt;OPEN&lt;br&gt;CLOSED&lt;br&gt;CANCELLED&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="1080" width="300" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="rules" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;" value="&lt;b&gt;Module constraints&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;M1. Mentor registration requires an ACTIVE User whose PlatformRole is STUDENT or ALUMNI. A STUDENT mentor must have yearOfStudy ≥ 2. Each eligible User has at most one MentorProfile.&lt;br&gt;M2. MentorProfile.status is the single mentor-availability value. Registration requires a mentoring bio and at least one MentorExpertise; duplicate registration is rejected.&lt;br&gt;M3. Only the MentorProfile owner may create, edit, close, or cancel their slots. Protected actions always recheck AccountStatus and eligibility.&lt;br&gt;M4. A slot requires topic, description, schedule, capacity, and endTime &amp;gt; startTime. IN_PERSON requires location; ONLINE requires meetingLink. Conflicting mentor schedules are rejected. ONE_TIME has exactly one occurrence; WEEKLY and BIWEEKLY generate dated occurrences through recurrenceEndDate.&lt;br&gt;M5. MentorshipOccurrence preserves each dated session. Past state is derived from endsAt; cancellation uses cancelledAt. Past or cancelled occurrences are retained and are not represented by an unsupported COMPLETED workflow.&lt;br&gt;M6. Joining enrolls an ACTIVE STUDENT in the entire MentorshipSlot series. The slot must be OPEN, have a future uncancelled occurrence, and have capacity. The creating mentor cannot join their own slot.&lt;br&gt;M7. At most one current enrollment exists per slot/student pair. isCurrent means leftAt is empty and the slot is not CANCELLED. Leaving sets leftAt after confirmation and preserves enrollment history.&lt;br&gt;M8. currentEnrollmentCount and availablePlaceCount are derived from current enrollments. FULL is derived when currentEnrollmentCount ≥ capacity; it is not a stored SlotStatus. Capacity cannot be reduced below the current count.&lt;br&gt;M9. CLOSED blocks new joins but preserves existing enrollments. CANCELLED blocks joins and notifies all currently enrolled students. Closing, cancellation, past occurrences, enrollments, and leave history are retained.&lt;br&gt;M10. Slot schedule edits must pass conflict checks, preserve past occurrences, and notify current mentees of material changes. Recurring-series edits affect only eligible future occurrences.&lt;br&gt;M11. Only AVAILABLE mentors appear in the mentor directory. Slot browsing supports topic, schedule, mode, location, and derived availability filters; full and closed slots remain visibly labelled where requirements call for them.&lt;br&gt;M12. Expertise levels, experience years, verification, completion, and mentor-driven mentee removal are outside current requirements. Notifications are informational and never grant enrollment or authority." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="1690" width="2660" height="430" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="eUserStudent" edge="1" parent="1" source="user" target="student" value="user 1     student profile 0..1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;dashed=1;endArrow=none;startArrow=none;fontSize=17;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="eUserAlumni" edge="1" parent="1" source="user" target="alumni" value="user 1     alumni profile 0..1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;dashed=1;endArrow=none;startArrow=none;fontSize=17;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
